<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
    <Worksheet ss:Name="Dia">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_vlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哦，是你！[P=0.5]我只是在吃点心&#10;我是说…跟一个高地人聊天。&#10;在更北方有一个村庄叫#Location_Dunderhead;。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Vlad is eating a villager</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Oh it's you![P=.5] I was just having a snack -- I mean chat with one of the highlanders. Further to the north there is a village called #Location_Dunderhead;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_vlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">他们为#location_hv;定期输送火药，&#10;我觉得你可以搭顺风车。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">They supply #location_hv; with gunpowder and regularly send shipments there. I sense that they will be able to give you a ride.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_mcleod1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我思念我的远在他乡妻子……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Highlander ref.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I miss my wife...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_mcleod2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">生命诚可贵，房产价更高……&#10;别在外流浪了，赶快回家去吧。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You have but one life! If you value it, then turn yourself around and go home!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_druid1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哎呀，很好，很好……看看我们遇到了啥，&#10;新鲜出笼的肉脚菜鸟！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Clockwork orange reference</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Well, well, well... What 'ave we 'ere! Looks like a fancy party of dainties, come from the castle.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_druid2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是时候结束了……&#10;不可能有人在穿越这片树林后…[P=1]&#10;…还活着！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Holy Grail Ref.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This shall be the end... for you. You'll never pass through this wood…[P=1]    …alive!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_beasts1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">旅行者，你好！[P=.5]&#10;我听说#Location_HL;被可怕的牛头人袭击了！&#10;所以我想我还是放弃我的风车我的农场，&#10;搬到#Location_Veiditorp;去。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Greetings traveller![P=.5] I heard stories about tribes of beastmen who would attack people here in the #Location_HL;, so I figured I'd abandon my windmill and move to #Location_Veiditorp;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_beasts2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">听说，那里有很多发着光带刺青的&#10;牛头怪，还有红色有角三倍速！！&#10;毫不夸张地说，吓着哥了!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">According to the stories, there were amazingly strong beasts, with glowing tatoos and magical weapons. Sounded really scary to me, to say the least!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">欢迎来到#Location_dunderhead;，皇家火药供应基地！&#10;你要去哪里？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Welcome to #Location_dunderhead;, the royal gunpowder supplier! Where are you headed?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你打算一路地奔去#Location_hv;？&#10;等你到达那都要猴年马月了…&#10;鞋也不知要跑坏多少双！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Must be commuter - star wars ref. (computer). Navigating an asteroid field(?)… "That's impossible even for a computer."</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You're planning on walking to #Location_hv;? That's impossible, even for a commuter.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们刚好准备运货到那儿，&#10;你愿意的话我们可以带上你。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">the second sentence was revised, to be less colloquial/familiar/casual.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We were just getting ready to send a shipment up there. If you like we could give you a ride. </Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_intro4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊啊啊啊！！[P=1]&#10;牛，牛人…牛头人来了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">RAAAAAH!!![P=1] The beasts are coming!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_intro5</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我擦！不能在这里当活靶子！&#10;[P=1]所有人，快，进入火药储存室！&#10;[P=.5]这些房子能完整保存就再好不过了，&#10;会升值的，你懂的！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">this line was revised, the final sentence added.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Holy crap! We're sitting ducks out here![P=1] Everybody! Quick, get into the gunpowder storage![P=.5] You'll handle this, right?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_chief_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">所有人类！在牛头人部落的力量前颤抖吧！[P=0.5]&#10;灭了这个小山寨！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">big goblin chief is the final boss of this mission</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">All humans shall tremble before the might of the tribes![P=0.5] Destroy this puny village!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_save1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">太好了！没想到牛头人真的被打跑了…嘿嘿！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Karl. Apparently, the speaker bet Karl that the heroes could not defend the village.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm impressed! I never thought you could actually pull it off…</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_save2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#ViMN3;，我愿赌服输，欠你10块！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#ViMN3;, I owe you big! Ten bucks at least!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_save3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">好啦！现在登上货车，出发去#Location_HV;吧。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Well then! Let's get this shipment over to #Location_HV;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_perf1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哇，你竟然成功地保护了大家的房子！&#10;来，这个很带感的玩意儿给你，就当作对你的答谢。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Wow, you even managed to save all the houses! Here, take this trinket as a token of our gratitude.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_perf2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们的铁匠#Her_Angus;只用了一些别针&#10;[P=1]和一把猎枪，就造出了这货！给力吧！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Our blacksmith and handyman #Her_Angus; made this fine prize using only a paperclip[P=1] and a shotgun!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_village_perf3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">基本上可以出发啦, &#10;准备好了就坐到前面来,&#10; 我们就会前往 #Location_HV;.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We're pretty much good to go, so just get on the cart when you're ready and we'll head on to #Location_HV;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_help</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">救命！[P=1] 牛，牛人，牛头人杀过来了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">HELP![P=1] Beastmen raiders!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_helped_m</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我想我快玩儿蛋去了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I thought I was a goner!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_helped_f1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">真丢人#CiMN7;，你呆在这儿！&#10;现在谁去风车那边看看？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Hrafn</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's a shame #CiMN7; left. Now who will tend to the windmill?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_helped_f2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我想他已经失去了斗志，我很好奇他是否也把自己的武器给丢了。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">there's a magic sword around the back of the windmill</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I think he left his valuables. I wonder if he also left his blade...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_sad</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">…</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_Vlad_bridge1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">桥被毁了…擦！咱都赶了这么远路……这不是坑爹呢吗？！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Curse those foul beasts! The bridge has been sabotaged!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_Vlad_bridge2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊，我有个主意…[P=1]&#10;咱们偷了旁边这艘飞艇，然后开往#location_hv;！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The only sensible thing to do is…[P=1] Steal that Airship, and fly it all the way to #location_hv;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_Vlad_preship</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们该去没些这吸血…学者的地方…额，他先走了，&#10;我来驾驶！你继续放哨！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We shall boldy go where no vamp-- err, MAN has gone before! I'll pilot! You keep lookout!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_Text_Vlad_Airship</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我感应到城里出了大骚乱，我要立即回去一趟…&#10;你来掌舵！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">they are flying over the swamps in their airship. Vlad senses that the "imposters" are approaching his castle, and therefore has to bail. Tells the player to take the helm of the airship, so Vlad can disappear. (Star Wars reference. I sense a great disturbance in the force.) </Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I sense a great disturbance in my town. Take the helm!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
