        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_PoI_storage</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看起来是个勉强能算的上是储藏室的房间…[P=1]&#10;…当然，门是锁着的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like a storage room of sorts…[P=1]    ...The door is locked, of course.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like a storage room of sorts…[P=1]    ...The door is locked, of course.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_PoI_dock</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看来有个飞艇在这儿“着陆”了。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like an airship was anchored here recently.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_PoI_picnic</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哥布林的野餐…[P=1]&#10;…够摆一茶几的啦！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A goblin picnic...[P=1]    ...How peculiar.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#HL_PoI_knight</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这位骑士像是被城管请去喝了茶。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Moon stone ref.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This knight looks like he's had a really hard day.</Data>
